# dilution — every `graphify query` spent most of its node budget on a dependency
# nobody here edits, and the answer to a question about *this* repo came back
# ranked against upstream's internals.
#
# The submodule is still pinned, still buildable, still documented in
# docs/WRENAI_INTEGRATION.md. It is simply not part of this repository's map.
